# issue-flow — harness init (`/iflow-init`)

Follow this skill to **cold-start or check the issue-flow harness** in a project — the editor-facing counterpart of the CLI's `issue-flow init`.{% if commands_supported %} Matches `{{ agent_dir }}/{{ commands_dir }}/iflow-init.md`.{% endif %}

This is **not** the step that pulls a GitHub issue into `{{ issueflows_dir }}/`. That is **`/iflow-capture`** (chat: `iflow capture`). `/iflow-init` is **off-path**: `/iflow` never auto-dispatches here.

